":221,"description":"TXY"},{"type":"Region","start":407,"end":806,"description":"May not be required for kinase activity; required to stimulate MEF2C activity"},{"type":"Motif","start":505,"end":539,"description":"Nuclear localization signal"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":720,"end":720,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":733,"end":733,"description":"Phosphothreonine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with MAP2K5. Forms oligomers (By similarity). Interacts with MEF2A, MEF2C and MEF2D; the interaction phosphorylates the MEF2s and enhances transcriptional activity of MEF2A, MEF2C but not MEF2D (By similarity). Interacts with SGK1. Preferentially interacts with PML isoform PML-4 but shows interaction also with its other isoforms: isoform PML-1, isoform PML-2, isoform PML-3 and isoform PML-6. Interacts (via N-terminal half) with HSP90AB1-CDC37 chaperone complex in resting cells; the interaction is MAP2K5-independent and prevents MAPK7 from ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation (PubMed:23428871). Interacts with STUB1/CHIP; the interaction is enhanced in the presence of IGF1 or MAP2K5 and promotes STUB1/CHIP E3 ligase activity (PubMed:20724525)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q13164-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":677,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000299612.11"],"refseq":["NM_139032.3"],"refseqProteins":["NP_620601.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,140,677]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":139,"original":"MAEPLKEEDGEDGSAEPPGPVKAEPAHTAASVAAKNLALL","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":139,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":89,"foldedMissing":89,"features":[[0,1,0],[1,76,0],[2,85,0],[3,9,0],[4,62,0],[5,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q13164-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q13164-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":63.4,"plddt":[[70,2],[90,10],[70,1],[90,39],[70,3],[90,7],[70,2],[90,1],[70,3],[50,16],[70,2],[90,6],[70,8],[90,27],[70,